#. module: bf_property_operations_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_property_operations_privacy.purpose_property_shift
msgid ""
"Ce registre porte sur le travail, pas sur la personne : il\n"
"                ne contient ni appréciation de rendement, ni relevé de\n"
"                présence, ni heures travaillées."
msgstr ""
"This register is about the work, not about the person: it\n"
"                contains no performance appraisal, no attendance record\n"
"                and no hours worked."

#. module: bf_property_operations_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_property_operations_privacy.purpose_property_shift
msgid ""
"Cette tenue repose sur la relation d'emploi : elle sert à\n"
"                confier le travail, à savoir qui le tient et à le transmettre\n"
"                d'un quart à l'autre. Elle ne repose pas sur votre\n"
"                consentement, et ne vous est pas demandée comme un choix."
msgstr ""
"Keeping it rests on the employment relationship: it serves to\n"
"                assign the work, to know who holds it and to pass it on\n"
"                from one shift to the next. It does not rest on your\n"
"                consent, and is not put to you as a choice."

#. module: bf_property_operations_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_property_operations_privacy.purpose_property_shift
msgid ""
"L'employeur tient un registre des quarts de travail : la\n"
"                plage, l'équipe, les personnes affectées, et le travail\n"
"                d'entretien porté par chaque quart : ce qui a été réglé, ce qui\n"
"                a été passé au quart suivant et ce qui a été retiré de la\n"
"                liste, avec la raison."
msgstr ""
"The employer keeps a register of shifts: the\n"
"                period, the team, the persons assigned, and the maintenance\n"
"                work carried by each shift: what was settled, what was\n"
"                passed to the next shift and what was taken off the\n"
"                list, with the reason."

#. module: bf_property_operations_privacy
#: model:privacy.purpose,name:bf_property_operations_privacy.purpose_property_shift
msgid "Quarts de travail de l'équipe d'entretien"
msgstr "Shifts of the maintenance team"
